# codes:
file "meas_when.sp" deck
  title "meas_when"
  comment " oracle: ngspice-45 com_measure2.c measure_parse_when, com_measure_when (no rise/fall/cross: the first crossing); inpcom.c braces a numparam right-hand side but not v(...); runs: w1 = w4 = 8.33429e-08"
  param half = 0.5
  measure w1 tran when (cross cross (v (a)) value=0.5 count=1)
  measure w2 tran when (cross rise (v (a)) value=(v(b)) count=2 delay=1u)
  measure w3 tran when (cross fall last (v (a)) value=half)
  measure w4 tran when (cross cross (v (a)) value=0.5 count=1)
